flowchart LR
    subgraph INPUT[Input and discovery]
      CLI[CLI] --> CONFIG[Config loader]
      CONFIG --> PROJECTS[Project discovery]
      EDITOR[Editor LSP] --> PROJECTS
      API[HTTP API] --> PROJECTS
    end

    subgraph CORE[Runtime and extension graph]
      PROJECTS --> RUNTIME[Project runtime]
      RUNTIME --> CATALOG[Extension catalog]
      CATALOG --> ORDER[Dependency ordering]
      ORDER --> ADMIT[Admission checks]
      ADMIT --> PLUGINS[Loaded extensions]
      PLUGINS --> FORMAT[Format registry]
      PLUGINS --> RULES[Lint rules]
      PLUGINS --> COMMANDS[Command registry]
    end

    subgraph DATA[Snapshots and execution]
      RUNTIME --> SNAPSHOT[Project snapshot]
      SNAPSHOT --> CACHE[Snapshot cache]
      CACHE --> RUN[Check run]
      RUN --> RESULTS[Results]
      RESULTS --> HISTORY[Run history]
      HISTORY --> DIFF[Diff engine]
    end

    subgraph OUTPUT[Clients and feedback]
      COMMANDS --> TERMINAL[Terminal output]
      RESULTS --> DIAGNOSTICS[Diagnostics]
      DIAGNOSTICS --> EDITOR
      DIFF --> REVIEW[Review report]
      REVIEW --> API
      CACHE --> SESSION[Editor session]
      SESSION --> EDITOR
    end

    FORMAT --> RUN
    RULES --> RUN
    CONFIG --> SNAPSHOT
    API --> REVIEW
    CLI --> COMMANDS
    PROJECTS --> SESSION
    DIFF --> COMMANDS
    ADMIT --> SNAPSHOT
